      `<strong>Search over internal documents.</strong> Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) lets staff ask questions of your manuals, rules of employment, product specifications and past proposals, your ${ja("社内文書")} (internal documents), and get an answer with links to the exact source passages. The RAG section below explains why doing this properly in Japanese takes more than uploading PDFs to a chatbot.`,
