      `Two practical points shape the design. First, LINE Official Account plans are priced by message volume, so automated broadcasts cost money and irritate customers if overused; we favour messages the customer asked for and carefully segmented broadcasts over mass pushes. Second, LINE Notify, which many companies used for internal alerts, ended in March 2025. Internal alerts need a new route, such as the Messaging API itself, Slack, Chatwork or Microsoft Teams, and we migrate old Notify scripts as part of automation work.`,
